	DCA FEXIT
	TAD I FGENIO	/GET UNIT+FUNCTION
	   6000		/THE REST IS NOT OUR BISNESS
	JMP .+4		/SKIP THE PARAMETER WORDS
FUNC,	   ZBLOCK 3	/THE 3 PARAMETERS
	SNA		/ERROR ?
